    "detailed_description": "You roll a marble that needs to escape a flaming Tornado and pass through a procedurally generated unique platform.<br />\r\nThe game is fast, easy to pick up, hard to master.<br />\r\nSeems simple, but has unique physics based platforming gameplay.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRoll by the Viking port or the Mayan ruins.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTry to beat the different challenges in the best time you can.<br />\r\nYou can try to beat the short course, but there are also longer and even infinite procedural courses.",
    "about_the_game": "You roll a marble that needs to escape a flaming Tornado and pass through a procedurally generated unique platform.<br />\r\nThe game is fast, easy to pick up, hard to master.<br />\r\nSeems simple, but has unique physics based platforming gameplay.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRoll by the Viking port or the Mayan ruins.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTry to beat the different challenges in the best time you can.<br />\r\nYou can try to beat the short course, but there are also longer and even infinite procedural courses.",
    "short_description": "A Physics based marble run with procedural generated platform levels. Try to beat the best time. The premise is simple, but controlling and balanced the ball, and escaping the tornado behind you, is hard to master. Skill based gaming.",
